#! mathcas 2 notebook

#% title
# is_ground

#% text
# `is_ground(e)` gives `true` when `e` holds no unknown symbol, so that it can be evaluated to a number or a value.

#% section
# Examples

#% subsection
# Basic examples

#% cell
is_ground(2 + sqrt(3))
#% output
#= true

#% cell
is_ground(x + 1)
#% output
#= false

#% cell
is_ground(pi^2)
#% output
#= true

#% section
# See also

#% text
# `free_of`, `variables`, `is_number`
